Q8. What is Hot Reload in Flutter? 

It updates UI instantly without restarting the app. 

  

Q9. What is Scaffold in Flutter? 

It provides basic app layout like AppBar, Drawer, Body, BottomNavigationBar. 

  

Q10. What is pubspec.yaml? 

It is a configuration file used to manage dependencies, assets, fonts in Flutter project. 

  

Q11. What is main() in Flutter? 

It is the starting point of a Flutter application. 

  

Q12. What is runApp()? 

It starts the Flutter app and loads the root widget. 

 

